                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "08933710-4ccf-4568-bbf7-ea4c03548a70",
                        "entry_id": "0b7b189a-ed58-3024-8383-9638fe6663cb",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "survies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a85ce47-20c4-382b-9ca5-118ab58f0e51",
                        "entry_id": "0b7b189a-ed58-3024-8383-9638fe6663cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "État de celui qui survit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "edbc0987-326f-4739-967f-707eb426b9a1",
                                "sense_id": "4a85ce47-20c4-382b-9ca5-118ab58f0e51",
                                "text": "En cas de survie, l’un des contractants s’oblige…."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c61240b1-c318-4ff0-9e42-8bd832b344b6",
                                "sense_id": "4a85ce47-20c4-382b-9ca5-118ab58f0e51",
                                "text": "Gains de survie."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30315d37-fd73-3c9a-9e1d-5208c3a8a47f",
                        "entry_id": "0b7b189a-ed58-3024-8383-9638fe6663cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Prolongement de l’existence après la mort."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cd97de4-4a10-48a7-a0d3-5b0d9eada622",
                                "sense_id": "30315d37-fd73-3c9a-9e1d-5208c3a8a47f",
                                "text": "Croire à la survie."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "05a594c9-c439-3129-84dd-7de3a008c7da",
                        "entry_id": "0b7b189a-ed58-3024-8383-9638fe6663cb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fait de se maintenir en vie dans un environnement défavorable ou mortifère."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f96ae7ca-d57e-405b-8f48-115bd136118a",
                                "sense_id": "05a594c9-c439-3129-84dd-7de3a008c7da",
                                "text": "La survie dans ce milieu hostile nécessite de bien connaître quelles plantes sont comestibles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f563228-0dd3-4661-90ff-7b36c26af451",
                                "sense_id": "05a594c9-c439-3129-84dd-7de3a008c7da",
                                "text": "Une telle situation rend la survie du sarde plus difficile que jamais et condamne les sardophones a un statut de diglossie, loin du bilinguisme souhaité, dans lequel leur langue apparait cantonnée, plus que jamais, à des situations de communication limitées."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9694bae-a110-4b51-b50d-a242cf426657",
                                "sense_id": "05a594c9-c439-3129-84dd-7de3a008c7da",
                                "text": "Une décision justifiée par les limites de la survie en mer dans cette zone à environ dix miles nautiques (soit 18 kilomètres) à l’ouest de Faial."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4977ae73-db76-404a-a65c-414e67c7624e",
                        "source_entry_id": "0b7b189a-ed58-3024-8383-9638fe6663cb",
                        "target_lang_word": "Überleben",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Überleben",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c5b96c7-4fae-3058-b6b6-32e23e0d8722",
                                        "entry_id": "f3559e4a-b3b7-3a31-a36f-381555902acc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "weitere (bewusste) Existenz (vor allem nach einer Bedrohung)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cc3e5d4-38c4-47c6-b6c8-b3ed2c918e1f",
                                                "sense_id": "3c5b96c7-4fae-3058-b6b6-32e23e0d8722",
                                                "text": "„Die Einigung der 132 Mitgliedsstaaten des Weltbiodiversitätsrats (IPBES) könnte entscheidend sein für das Überleben vieler Tier- und Pflanzenarten auf der Erde.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7edfc4e1-4bfa-46ed-b6e5-21aa0e4edeb6",
                                                "sense_id": "3c5b96c7-4fae-3058-b6b6-32e23e0d8722",
                                                "text": "„Am 21. April 1945 erreichte die Rote Armee Berlin-Buch. Anna konnte den Hidschab ablegen und sich erstmals wieder offen in das jüdische Mädchen zurückverwandeln, das sie war, ohne um ihr Leben fürchten zu müssen; ein jüdisches Mädchen, das sein Überleben Muslimen verdankte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "810b6449-097a-4ee1-9d84-ac645a3827f3",
                                                "sense_id": "3c5b96c7-4fae-3058-b6b6-32e23e0d8722",
                                                "text": "„Der Amateurarchäologe Ian Cooke stellte fest, dass das nördliche Ende der Passage stets zum Sonnenaufgang am Mittsommerstag ausgerichtet ist, und sah darin einen Beleg für das Überleben des megalithischen Sonnenkults in die Zeit der Kelten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c9caf49-0e66-4915-8e07-d84bfe7e95a2",
                                                "sense_id": "3c5b96c7-4fae-3058-b6b6-32e23e0d8722",
                                                "text": "„Um ihr Überleben zu sichern, musste sie sukzessive ihren Hausrat verkaufen, später sogar bei den verhassten britischen Invasoren Geld leihen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4985be4e-5509-4726-835a-2a4820290f7d",
                                                "sense_id": "3c5b96c7-4fae-3058-b6b6-32e23e0d8722",
                                                "text": "„Lindner kämpft um sein politisches Überleben – und buhlt nun um AfD-Wähler und die Zuneigung von Friedrich Merz gleichermaßen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad106529-0fdc-4be0-8aed-a4b95eb1a5f4",
                                                "sense_id": "3c5b96c7-4fae-3058-b6b6-32e23e0d8722",
                                                "text": "„Das Überleben ist der härteste Endpunkt klinischer Studien, da er eine Aussage darüber trifft, welchen Impact eine Therapiemaßnahme im Hinblick auf die Lebensverlängerung hat. Das Überleben kann als Überlebensdauer oder Überlebensrate quantifiziert werden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f9c2f65f-cf1e-47a0-815f-a8b197aefea7",
                        "source_entry_id": "0b7b189a-ed58-3024-8383-9638fe6663cb",
                        "target_lang_word": "survival",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "survival",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3c8f5b0-3257-33de-8cf9-2cbf269cdb73",
                                        "entry_id": "89de92df-d108-32a2-b9a6-4908efdf9d02",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fact or act of surviving; continued existence or life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79a7a276-08da-46e7-a119-c71c0f12cd29",
                                                "sense_id": "c3c8f5b0-3257-33de-8cf9-2cbf269cdb73",
                                                "text": "His survival in the open ocean was a miracle; he had fully expected to die."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28b6a94c-06a3-3fa5-9a71-2591b856631d",
                                        "entry_id": "89de92df-d108-32a2-b9a6-4908efdf9d02",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, relating to or aiding survival."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74133ccd-b4d2-4a32-9ba2-b2ca92ca3b19",
                                                "sense_id": "28b6a94c-06a3-3fa5-9a71-2591b856631d",
                                                "text": "persecution survival plan"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a5616ed-7cc8-4896-89b2-aaf236f5aa03",
                                                "sense_id": "28b6a94c-06a3-3fa5-9a71-2591b856631d",
                                                "text": "His survival kit had all the things he needed in the wilderness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbbaa9e6-1636-43e7-8e8e-6086f6d289a6",
                                                "sense_id": "28b6a94c-06a3-3fa5-9a71-2591b856631d",
                                                "text": "When I am not playing pinball or working at my survival job, I am usually writing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "824edfc6-fa1e-32d5-b5c4-1c17f80477eb",
                                        "entry_id": "89de92df-d108-32a2-b9a6-4908efdf9d02",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The avoidance of relegation or demotion to a lower league or division."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9db545c8-bae5-46fb-9abf-421f27a60e22",
                                                "sense_id": "824edfc6-fa1e-32d5-b5c4-1c17f80477eb",
                                                "text": "[…] a team that have turned snatching relegation from the jaws of top-flight survival into an art form […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cddf3ed-0f69-46ac-bbd0-e4445a563ef9",
                                                "sense_id": "824edfc6-fa1e-32d5-b5c4-1c17f80477eb",
                                                "text": "\"Before you know it, you find yourself flirting around the relegation places and the season becomes a battle for survival.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "328e3aa5-b54c-3e6b-bfb4-3af28757086e",
                                        "entry_id": "89de92df-d108-32a2-b9a6-4908efdf9d02",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A custom or belief that persists in folklore from earlier times, when the rationale behind it is forgotten."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d9f703b-24c4-4894-b2f4-56949e9424dc",
                                                "sense_id": "328e3aa5-b54c-3e6b-bfb4-3af28757086e",
                                                "text": "Thus, if some old rhyme or saying has in one place a solemn import in philosophy or religion, while elsewhere it lies at the level of the nursery, there is some ground for treating the serious version as the more original, and the playful one as its mere lingering survival."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d5510b3-e196-433a-8d04-589ffc1603c8",
                                                "sense_id": "328e3aa5-b54c-3e6b-bfb4-3af28757086e",
                                                "text": "Another survival of marriage by capture is discovered among the Ceylonese, where it is common at royal marriages for the king and queen to throw perfumed balls and squirt scented water at each other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7a60f4c-1f1f-4668-8fb6-c9ae3c0f3a5e",
                                                "sense_id": "328e3aa5-b54c-3e6b-bfb4-3af28757086e",
                                                "text": "The banded ones were all dressed in white gowns — a gay survival from Old Style days, when cheerfulness and May-time were synonyms — days before the habit of taking long views had reduced emotions to a monotonous average."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
